  "details": "Description:\nQuickly changing worlds, for example accepting an invite or choosing one through the worlds menu, can result in the player being unable to move and unable to interact with certain menu items. It is not a complete softlock but it does break locomotion and certain menus until you either reload the game or find a way to load into a new world. I first encountered this bug when I accepted a second invite request moments after loading into the first invite world. More recently I encountered it again by trying to change instance types after I loaded into an instance I did not mean to. Here are the reproducible steps. \nReproducible steps:\n1. Load into any chosen world. For example the VRChat default home world.  \n2. As soon as you can open your worlds menu, open the current world information menu (Button at the top left of worlds menu).\n3. Hit GO to reload the world.\n4. Repeat steps 1-3 until you can no longer move your avatar. The player should now be softlocked.",
